<Layout title="Succulent Identifier by Photo — Free Online Tool" description="Identify succulents from a photo for free. Upload rosette, leaf and side views for likely species matches." canonicalPath="/succulent-identifier/">
  <IdentifierLanding eyebrow="Succulent identifier" title="Name that succulent." intro="Rosette shape, leaf texture and stem growth help separate lookalike succulents. A few clean angles can make the difference." tips={["Take one photo directly above a rosette and one from the side.","Keep leaf tips, texture, spots or powdery coating visible.","Include any flowers and avoid wiping the plant before photographing it."]} />
